  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "st_e1ea3ef298cb",
      "speaker": "Vladimir Putin",
      "role": "President",
      "date": "2026-10-05",
      "text": "It would be hard to overestimate your personal contribution to the development of the strategic partnership and alliance between Tajikistan and Russia.",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "reassurance",
      "stance": 2,
      "source_url": "http://en.kremlin.ru/events/president/news/80922"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_88996869b5e0",
      "speaker": "Vladimir Putin",
      "role": "President",
      "date": "2026-10-05",
      "text": "I will be delighted to continue our constructive and friendly communication and our fruitful cooperation on the topical issues of the bilateral, regional and international agendas.",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "commitment",
      "stance": 2,
      "source_url": "http://en.kremlin.ru/events/president/news/80922"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_9b2b2cc0512a",
      "speaker": "Vladimir Putin",
      "role": "President",
      "date": "2026-10-04",
      "text": "our country has acquired a reliable space-based missile defence shield: an effective instrument for maintaining global strategic parity",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "policy_announcement",
      "stance": 0,
      "source_url": "http://en.kremlin.ru/events/president/news/80919"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_6081107036db",
      "speaker": "Vladimir Putin",
      "role": "President",
      "date": "2026-10-04",
      "text": "are promptly providing the Armed Forces and units participating in the special military operation with essential data",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "commitment",
      "stance": -1,
      "source_url": "http://en.kremlin.ru/events/president/news/80919"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_35e1f41a7d8a",
      "speaker": "Vladimir Putin",
      "role": "President",
      "date": "2026-10-04",
      "text": "It is important to continue expanding the capabilities of our orbital satellite constellation and ground-based infrastructure, developing advanced technologies for cutting-edge weapons and equipment, and conducting promising studies",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "policy_announcement",
      "stance": 0,
      "source_url": "http://en.kremlin.ru/events/president/news/80919"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_cb7ee2ec0942",
      "speaker": "Vladimir Putin",
      "role": "President",
      "date": "2026-10-02",
      "text": "The Centre-2026 command post exercise is being held under the Armed Forces training plan, in conjunction with the Interaction-2026 exercise scheduled as part of the Collective Security Treaty Organisation's plan.",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "policy_announcement",
      "stance": 1,
      "source_url": "http://en.kremlin.ru/events/president/transcripts/80912"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_21ec34d7193c",
      "speaker": "Vladimir Putin",
      "role": "President",
      "date": "2026-10-02",
      "text": "The main objective of the exercise is to improve the skills of commanders at all levels in repelling external aggression.",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "commitment",
      "stance": 0,
      "source_url": "http://en.kremlin.ru/events/president/transcripts/80912"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_358524e4d61e",
      "speaker": "Vladimir Putin",
      "role": "President",
      "date": "2026-10-02",
      "text": "I am confident that the results of the Centre-2026 and Interaction-2026 exercises, along with the experience gained by the personnel, will enhance our effectiveness in responding to external threats to our countries' security.",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "reassurance",
      "stance": 1,
      "source_url": "http://en.kremlin.ru/events/president/transcripts/80912"
    }
  ],
